1.6-1:
[New] validate_ip() function for strict octet 0-255 IP validation using BASH_REMATCH
[New] sanitize_mod() function restricts rule names to alphanumeric, underscore, hyphen
[New] safe_source() validates root ownership and non-world-writable before sourcing files
[New] cleanup trap on EXIT/INT/TERM releases lock files and flock FD
[Fix] eliminated command injection in BAN_COMMAND execution; removed temp file
      approach and config re-sourcing from hot loop
[Fix] secured temp files with mktemp replacing predictable PID-based names
[Fix] atomic locking with flock replacing TOCTOU check-then-act race condition
[Fix] tlog gunzip/gzip race replaced with zcat read-only approach
[Fix] alert.bfd variable quoting and grep -Fw for literal IP matching
[Change] backtick command substitution replaced with $() in bfd and alert.bfd
[Change] deprecated $[expr] arithmetic replaced with $((expr)) in get_state
[New] detect_log_paths() auto-detects AUTH, KERNEL, MAIL log paths for
      cross-distro compatibility (RHEL/Debian/Ubuntu)
[New] MAIL_LOG_PATH config variable for mail log path detection
[New] format_table() wrapper with column fallback to tr for minimal systems
[New] get_file_size() wrapper in tlog with stat fallback to wc -c
[Change] hardcoded /sbin/ip replaced with command -v discovery and hostname -I
         fallback
[Change] egrep replaced with grep -E across all rule files
[Change] hardcoded mail log paths replaced with $MAIL_LOG_PATH in 5 rules
         (dovecot, sendmail, courier, vpopmail, postfix)
[Change] sendmail rule REQ changed from /etc/init.d/sendmail to /usr/sbin/sendmail
[Change] added firewall examples in conf.bfd (iptables, firewalld, nftables,
         ip route) with BAN_COMMAND binary existence warning
[Fix] deprecated $[expr] arithmetic replaced with $((expr)) in check()
[Fix] BAN_COMMAND template now extracted raw from conf.bfd to prevent
      premature $ATTACK_HOST/$MOD expansion at source time
[Change] systematic variable quoting across bfd, tlog, conf.bfd,
         importconf, install.sh, uninstall.sh, cron.daily
[Change] backtick command substitution replaced with $() across all
         remaining files (tlog, conf.bfd, importconf, cron.daily,
         install.sh, and 18 rule files)
[Change] for-cat and for-ls antipatterns replaced with while-read loops
         and process substitution in bfd
[New] validate_config() function validates TRIG, EMAIL_ALERTS,
      LOCK_FILE_TIMEOUT, BAN_COMMAND, INSTALL_PATH at startup
[New] meaningful exit codes (EXIT_OK, EXIT_CONFIG_ERROR, EXIT_LOCK_ERROR,
      EXIT_PREREQ_ERROR) replace bare exit 1 throughout bfd
[Change] eout() refactored with local variables and single timestamp
[Change] apool_list() refactored with _apool_report() helper eliminating
         tripled code
[Fix] uninitialized LAST_HOST, LAST, SKIP_ALERT variables now initialized
[Fix] -a without argument no longer causes unbound variable error
[Fix] install.sh: added root check, set -eu, explicit mkdir tmp/,
      quoting, backtick replacement
[Change] tlog expr arithmetic replaced with $(()) throughout
[Change] copyright years updated to 2026 across all modified files
